{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"FlyfDPS41F8R9f5KHA8g2Q","review_id":"LSfj4oCopG2CG3IPw5Bzkw","date":"2013-08-31T20:29:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9486656188964844,"text_excerpt":"The seafood combination red curry and kaffir lime curry are my favorites so far here. The seafood clay pot and the eggplant green curry are also delicious. The cocktails seemed a little weak to me, but then again I am a 20-something New Orleanian so heed that warning with just a grain of sand. Our server was nice but seemed nervous most of the time. Perhaps he was new. The Indian puff bread is only $3 more and well worth it if your getting a curry to dip it in. I got my curry medium-spicy and I thought it was a very comfortable level of heat. Just perfect. Not uncomfortably hot but it definitely had a lingering spice to it. I like how they often have a server here who just walks around an..."},{"business_id":"FlyfDPS41F8R9f5KHA8g2Q","review_id":"SFuMgfBHxR45GatNkk4s1Q","date":"2015-06-09T15:04:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9471405744552612,"text_excerpt":"I really enjoyed eating here. I like the atmosphere but better yet the food is amazing. I came here with my sister and we had never tried thai before. For starters, we shared a bowl of (I think it is called) the Tom Yum Soup. That soup is life changing and one of the main reasons I want to go back. I would compare it to hot and sour soup that you get at Chinese restaurants but more amazing. For my meal, I got the beef drunken noodles and I love spicy foods so I got it really spicy. OMG...It was perfect. The flavors were so good, and I would definitely get it again. My sister got the shrimp pad thai and that was also good. I didn't think it was that expensive and definitely worth every pen..."},{"business_id":"FlyfDPS41F8R9f5KHA8g2Q","review_id":"oCSIVLzuVDuljuH8bhHWPA","date":"2016-05-03T02:17:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9425947666168213,"text_excerpt":"Foods here were delicious and the service was great. I've been here couple of time. Love all their curries, green curry is my favorite. Drunken fried rice is also a dish that I love and normally order. However, their drunken noodle's a bit too salty for me. It's a great place to catch up with friend."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"FlyfDPS41F8R9f5KHA8g2Q","photo_id":"sUYkWnfQ1zu9ceb2Nf0D0A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/sUYkWnfQ1zu9ceb2Nf0D0A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.856103241443634},{"business_id":"FlyfDPS41F8R9f5KHA8g2Q","photo_id":"OGN4GWZSXWlsji_ymzMEmQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/OGN4GWZSXWlsji_ymzMEmQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8558608889579773},{"business_id":"FlyfDPS41F8R9f5KHA8g2Q","photo_id":"816hV5jkQdpAhOWGcoprVg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/816hV5jkQdpAhOWGcoprVg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8402180671691895},{"business_id":"FlyfDPS41F8R9f5KHA8g2Q","photo_id":"rr61m23UpdbpMl6BngvfIg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/rr61m23UpdbpMl6BngvfIg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8130677938461304},{"business_id":"FlyfDPS41F8R9f5KHA8g2Q","photo_id":"FnpjjHaSydCoMlhdWzPtKw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/FnpjjHaSydCoMlhdWzPtKw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7702218294143677}]},"notebook_case":null}
